# IP-audit patterns for public-repo-ip-check.sh
#
# One extended-regex (grep -E) pattern per line. Blank lines and lines
# starting with # are ignored. Each pattern is OR'd together to form the
# scanner's match expression.
#
# This is the TRACKED example file — keep it generic. Copy it to
# tools/ip-patterns.local (already gitignored) and fill in your own
# employer-proprietary terms; the real file is never committed.
#
# Example patterns (fictional company/product names). No quoting needed —
# each line is read verbatim as one grep -E alternative.
[Ee]xample[Cc]orp
examplecorp\.net
examplecorp\.int
internal-widget-service
jdoe@examplecorp
